  "body": "If I read the spec correctly, when an attempt is made to navigate to \"about:config\" (e.g. via the URL bar) we land in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#navigate and in step 12 we have a \"fetch scheme\" so try to do a \"navigate fetch\".\r\n\r\nThen in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#process-a-navigate-fetch step 6.1 we try to fetch the request, which results in a network error.",
